@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title Lighting lifecycle and startup barrier
[*] --> StartupHook
StartupHook --> SharedCorners : create_lighting
SharedCorners --> OverlaySweeps : defer corner activity
OverlaySweeps --> CompatibilitySweep : excluded / dynamic sites
CompatibilitySweep --> ActiveCorners : activate fresh + reconcile existing
ActiveCorners --> RuntimeQueues : release barrier
SharedCorners --> FailedStartup : exception
OverlaySweeps --> FailedStartup : exception
CompatibilitySweep --> FailedStartup : exception
ActiveCorners --> FailedStartup : exception
FailedStartup --> [*] : readiness flags false; rethrow
RuntimeQueues --> SourceWork : sources process
SourceWork --> CornerChanges : contribution update
CornerChanges --> OverlayWork : queued change
OverlayWork --> RuntimeQueues
RuntimeQueues --> RestoredDaylight : saved round import
RestoredDaylight --> RuntimeQueues : apply_restored_lighting
note right of SharedCorners
Neighboring turfs share corner identity.
Yielding startup must retain barrier ownership.
end note
@enduml
